    "extraction_notes": [
      "PDF SHA-256 verified as 6c226a8d26fc87bf8f9bc6e0f23bafc78721184a0068f625058e15a50dbb9cda before extraction.",
      "Figures 1 through 4 and Figure 9 contain usable plotted curves. Curve points are manual readings from visible traces and grid coordinates; no points were interpolated between plotted readings.",
      "Figure 1 output curves were extracted for VGS = 2.0 V, 2.5 V, 3.0 V, 4.0 V, and 10 V. Figure 2 transfer curves were extracted for TA = 25 degC and 125 degC. Figure 3 capacitance curves were extracted for Ciss, Coss, and Crss.",
      "The table also specifies IDSS maximum = 1 uA at VDS = 100 V and VGS = 0 V, IGSS maximum = 100 nA at VGS = plus or minus 20 V and VDS = 0 V, Qg typical = 1.61 nC at VGS = 10 V, VDS = 50 V, ID = 0.2 A, and RthetaJA maximum = 357 K/W in still air on the stated FR-4 test board.",
      "No RthetaJC, gate resistance, body-diode reverse-recovery trr, or Qrr value is published in the supplied PDF. Safe operating area and normalized temperature curves were not included as extraction curves.",
      "Catalog cross-check discrepancy preserved: vdmos.crss catalog value is 2 pF, while the PDF states Crss typical = 7 pF at VDS = 50 V, VGS = 0 V, f = 1 MHz; the extracted value remains 7e-12 F, a 3.5x ratio, and was not altered to match the catalog."
